# DuckDB's browser build, loaded by the wasm REPL on its first DuckDB call: published per version by
# tools/duckdb-wasm-publish.sh, fetched for local runs by `make -f Makefile.wasm duckdb-wasm`, sha256-checked by both.
# `pin <version>` is what a build loads; `<version> <path> <sha256> <url>` is one file.  1.33.1-dev57.0 is DuckDB
# v1.5.4; its extensions sit at extensions/v<duckdb>/wasm_eh/, the layout custom_extension_repository expects.
pin 1.33.1-dev57.0
